s!<br></li><li> Fly over the city and fire rockets from 20,000 feet!<br></li><li> Watch the city burn! Blow up vehicles! Shatter glass! Rain debris!<br></li><li> Jump into Ouroboros and watch battle simulations.<br></li><li> 11 types of mechanical fire-breathing killing machines to play with.<br></li><li> Coming soon: More everything, plus multiplayer!</li></ul><br> Available for Arcades on SpringboardVR ",
